  {
   "id": "a121",
   "kind": "attr:alt",
   "en": "Coach David Ciboch, M.Ed. Sport Science, performing a barbell squat"
  },
  {
   "id": "h122",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"cb-dot\"></span><span><b>Coach David Ciboch</b><span>M.Ed. Sport Science · National-Team S&amp;C</span></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h123",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Who built this"
  },
  {
   "id": "h124",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Coached at the <em>national-team level.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h125",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "COMPETE isn’t a template from the internet. Every session was periodized by <strong style=\"color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;\">Coach David Ciboch</strong> — a decade of coaching from youth development to the UAE National Ice Hockey Team, applied to the exact window where off-ice work starts separating players."
  },
  {
   "id": "h126",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Master’s Degree (M.Ed.) — PE &amp; Sport Science"
  },
  {
   "id": "h127",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Certified Strength &amp; Conditioning Coach"
  },
  {
   "id": "h128",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Former National Team Coach — UAE Ice Hockey"
  },
  {
   "id": "h129",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "1,000+ athletes developed across 30+ countries"
  },
  {
   "id": "h130",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "02 — What's Inside"
  },
  {
   "id": "h131",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Everything you need to <em>get faster.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h132",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A complete, coach-built block of off-ice speed, power, and conditioning — written for a serious 15–18 player, not a generic gym template."
  },
  {
   "id": "h133",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "32 Coach-Built Sessions"
  },
  {
   "id": "h134",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Four sessions a week for eight weeks, each about 55–70 minutes. Every session follows the same five-part shape — just run them in order."
  },
  {
   "id": "h135",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Video for Every Exercise"
  },
  {
   "id": "h136",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No guessing what a move looks like. Every single exercise links to a clean demo video you can copy in seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "h137",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "5 Skill-Check Tests"
  },
  {
   "id": "h138",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Five simple, measurable tests — a real number to beat at Week 1, 4 and 8. Progress you can actually see, not just hope for."
  },
  {
   "id": "h139",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Easier &amp; Harder Scaling"
  },
  {
   "id": "h140",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Every move comes with a simpler version and a harder version — so it fits whether you're new to structured off-ice work or already training hard."
  },
  {
   "id": "h141",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The RAMP Warm-Up"
  },
  {
   "id": "h142",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A built-in 10-minute warm-up before every session — Raise, Activate, Mobilize, Prime — that doubles as your daily mobility and groin-prep work."
  },
  {
   "id": "h143",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Full Glossary &amp; Notes"
  },
  {
   "id": "h144",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Plain-English coaching notes and a complete glossary — so you know exactly what to do, and why, on every single rep."
  },
  {
   "id": "h145",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "03 — The Plan"
  },
  {
   "id": "h146",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The 8-week <em>journey.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h147",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Two four-week blocks. Intensity climbs to a peak, then unloads — so you arrive at each checkpoint sharp and fast, not buried."
  },
  {
   "id": "h148",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 1</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 1–4</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h149",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Build the Base"
  },
  {
   "id": "h150",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Sprint mechanics, acceleration, and elastic bounds at full intent — backed by single-leg strength and a hockey conditioning base. Intensity builds Week 1→3, then Week 4 deloads and you re-check."
  },
  {
   "id": "h151",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 2</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 5–8</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h152",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Peak &amp; Compete"
  },
  {
   "id": "h153",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Full-amplitude and reactive plyometrics, contrast power, max-velocity sprinting, and change-of-direction — finished with competition. Intensity peaks Week 6→7, then Week 8 tapers into the final checkpoint."
  },
  {
   "id": "h154",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Block 1 builds the speed-and-strength base; Block 2 extends the power and top-end — so the whole athlete shifts up and to the right. A faster, more explosive player who can repeat it all game."
  },
  {
   "id": "h155",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 4</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Deload + re-check</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h156",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 8</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Taper + final checkpoint</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h157",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "04 — A Week"
  },
  {
   "id": "h158",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The weekly <em>rhythm.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h159",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Four sessions a week. The four days rotate focus — straight-line speed, upper &amp; core, lateral power, and the engine — so the whole athlete gets built, with nothing missed."
  },
  {
   "id": "h160",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "h161",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Linear Speed &amp; Lower Power"
  },
  {
   "id": "h162",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Acceleration, sprint mechanics, and knee- and hinge-dominant strength — the straight-line burst and the legs that drive it."
  },
  {
   "id": "h163",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 2"
  },
  {
   "id": "h164",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Upper, Rotation &amp; Core"
  },
  {
   "id": "h165",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Push, pull, rotate, and brace — the upper body and trunk that win battles and transfer power to the ice."
  },
  {
   "id": "h166",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 3"
  },
  {
   "id": "h167",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Lateral Speed &amp; CoD"
  },
  {
   "id": "h168",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Lateral push, bounds, and groin durability — the edges, cuts, and side-to-side explosiveness hockey lives on."
  },
  {
   "id": "h169",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 4"
  },
  {
   "id": "h170",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Max-Velocity &amp; Compete"
  },
  {
   "id": "h171",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Top-end speed, full-body power, and conditioning — the engine that still fires in the third period."
  },
  {
   "id": "h172",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Four training days a week, with rest scheduled in — you train hard, then recover harder. That's where the gains land."
  },
  {
   "id": "h173",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "05 — Proof"
  },
  {
   "id": "h174",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Progress you can <em>measure.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h175",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Five simple tests — every one gives you a number to beat. Do the same five, in the same order, three times: Week 1, Week 4, and Week 8. No gym needed."
  },
