  {
   "id": "h201",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Your engine,<br>measured."
  },
  {
   "id": "h202",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Re-test at Week 1, 4 and 8 and watch every number climb — that's your off-ice work, proven."
  },
  {
   "id": "h203",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "06 — Players"
  },
  {
   "id": "h204",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Trusted by serious <em>players.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h205",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "From players and parents who wanted real off-ice speed and power — built for hockey, not bro-gym filler."
  },
  {
   "id": "h206",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "My acceleration and top speed both jumped — I felt it at tryouts. The conditioning days are brutal in the best way; I don't fade in the third anymore."
  },
  {
   "id": "h207",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "T"
  },
  {
   "id": "h208",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Tyler R."
  },
  {
   "id": "h209",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "U18 AAA player"
  },
  {
   "id": "h210",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Recruiters notice explosiveness. Eight weeks of this and my son's first three strides are a different gear — and he does it at home with bands and dumbbells."
  },
  {
   "id": "h211",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "K"
  },
  {
   "id": "h212",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Karen B."
  },
  {
   "id": "h213",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Hockey mom"
  },
  {
   "id": "h214",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Finally off-ice work actually built for hockey, not bro-gym stuff. It pairs perfectly with my lifting — this is the speed and power half I was missing."
  },
  {
   "id": "h215",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "J"
  },
  {
   "id": "h216",
